 1061                   ;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 1062                   ;
 1063                   ; Subroutine to write one IDE/ATA Disk sector (256 bytes)
 1064                   ; Address of data to write to disk passed in HL
 1065                   ; LBA bits 0 to 7 passed in C, bits 8 to 15 passed in B
 1066                   ; LBA bits 16 to 23 passed in E
 1067                   
 1068 F5C7              IDEWR:
